  "description": "QEPTUD crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 2/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C92 H116 Ho4 O32,C92 H116 Ho4 O32. From the CIF bond table, Ho1 (Ho) has 8 O neighbors; Ho2 (Ho) has 8 O neighbors; Ho1A (Ho) has 8 O neighbors; Ho2A (Ho) has 8 O neighbors; Ho3 (Ho) has 8 O neighbors; Ho4 (Ho) has 8 O neighbors; Ho3A (Ho) has 8 O neighbors; Ho4A (Ho) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 12 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.709-3.840 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 103.83-108.54°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C92H116Ho4O32. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
